body: "GitHub #1414 and #1415 are the same scheduled run with two independently observed portability defects. Windows schema-settings-history.integration.spec.ts generates an absolute drive-path static import; Node correctly refuses protocol d:. macOS codecov-verified-upload.integration.spec.ts executes sha256sum --check --strict against a checker that does not support those options. Keep the shipped schema isolation and uploader-integrity contracts. Generate a proper file URL for the audit import. Use actual Node SHA-256 verification in the workflow and retain approved/corrupt byte execution before real chmod. Provision the already pinned Bun runtime on nightly test legs now that packed SDK continuation acceptance executes both runtimes. Existing pm-gh1393 and pm-2x67z9 resolutions remain shipped; this distinct platform fixture delivery verifies those contracts without reopening or duplicating them. Hosted macOS and Windows Node 24 proof must follow local verification."
